    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world where even the bravest adventurers fear the forest, a girl named Fany decides to face the impossible. Alongside her loyal fairy companion, she embarks on a magical journey through forgotten lands filled with danger, secrets, and mystical creatures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retorno Nando</strong> is a <strong>2D platformer focused on action and exploration</strong>, where you control Fany through a challenge-packed adventure. The game blends simple combat, precise jumping, gem collection, and memorable boss fights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Platformer gameplay with action elements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>10 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with unique traps and enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Epic bosses</strong> that test your reflexes and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Immersive soundtrack and charming retro visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b Estimated playtime: <strong>1\u20132 hours</strong>, depending on skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity and a desire to prove herself, Fany doesn't run from the unknown \u2014 she runs toward it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a magical adventure full of action, growth, and surprises in a whimsical, unpredictable world.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world where even the bravest adventurers fear the forest, a girl named Fany decides to face the impossible. Alongside her loyal fairy companion, she embarks on a magical journey through forgotten lands filled with danger, secrets, and mystical creatures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retorno Nando</strong> is a <strong>2D platformer focused on action and exploration</strong>, where you control Fany through a challenge-packed adventure. The game blends simple combat, precise jumping, gem collection, and memorable boss fights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Platformer gameplay with action elements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>10 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with unique traps and enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Epic bosses</strong> that test your reflexes and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Immersive soundtrack and charming retro visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b Estimated playtime: <strong>1\u20132 hours</strong>, depending on skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity and a desire to prove herself, Fany doesn't run from the unknown \u2014 she runs toward it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a magical adventure full of action, growth, and surprises in a whimsical, unpredictable world.</strong></p>",
